<title>USA: Coastal Physician vice chairman resigns.</title>
<headline>Coastal Physician vice chairman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, N.C. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Physician Group Inc said on Friday John Hemingway, the company's vice chairman and member of its board of directors since 1982, has resigned from Coastal's board.</p>
<p>Hemingway cited personal reasons for his resignation, the company said.</p>
